        <p>GIVE EASE &amp; COMFORT DURING TEETHING. Pleasant, Co,linfr, Aperient for Children of all Ages. Try them and prove their value for yourselves. Sold everywhere in packets, is. 10. and 2s. 9d., or post free 14 or 34 stamps. J. PRITCHARD, CHEMIST, CuELE,IIANCII.I.-ZIEL (1:13osL</p>
