        <p>SECOND DIVISION. L. &amp; N.W. Albion Widnes Parish Church It Bank-st. Mission 6 3 2 1 .21 .15 7 *Newton-le-Willows It St. Elphin's 11 Sutton Victoria It Winwick-st. St. Oswi_lds ... 5 ... 2 ... 3 ... 0 ...11 ...24 .. 4 Warrington St. Mary's Penketh R 5 1 4 0 .11 ..28 ... 2 Orford 6 1 5 0 .35 .35 2 Peter Walker and Sons 4 0 4 0 2 25 0 *Newton-le-Willows have had two points deducted for play- ing an ineligible man. .</p>
